      "claim": "All transferable human L1 oral-bioavailability measurements are ≥24% (ampicillin 29%, amoxicillin 70–88%, ampicillin in cirrhosis 43%, theanine ~72–74%, maraviroc 24%, ALZ-801 ~52%, gabapentin enacarbil 64–83%, perindopril 66–95%, aminoglutethimide ≈100%, molsidomine 44–59%); none provides affirmative evidence for F < 20%.",
